{"seq":1,"slug":"automated-testing-tools","title":"自动化无障碍测试工具：axe-core、Lighthouse 与浏览器扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/testing/automated-testing-tools","wordCount":945,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动化无障碍测试工具-axe-core-lighthouse-与浏览器扩展\">自动化无障碍测试工具：axe-core、Lighthouse 与浏览器扩展</h1><p>自动化工具可以高效、可重复地检测约 30-40% 的 WCAG 违规问题，是无障碍工程流程的第一道防线。本文介绍主流工具的工作原理、使用方式和适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无障碍自动化工具基于规则引擎分析 DOM 和可访问性树，检测颜色对比度不足、缺少 alt 文本、ARIA 使用错误等可静态分析的问题。axe-core 是当前最广泛使用的开源引擎，被 Lighthouse、axe DevTools、jest-axe、cypress-axe 等工具共同采用。自动化工具的价值在于<strong>快速、一致、可集成到 CI</strong>，但无法检测键盘顺序的逻辑正确性、AT 的实际朗读体验等需要人工判断的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化测试工具的分层架构\">自动化测试工具的分层架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Tests[无障碍自动化测试] --&gt; Unit[单元测试层]&#10;    Tests --&gt; E2E[E2E 测试层]&#10;    Tests --&gt; Audit[审计扫描层]&#10;&#10;    Unit --&gt; JestAxe[jest-axe / @axe-core/react]&#10;    E2E --&gt; CypressAxe[cypress-axe / playwright-axe]&#10;    Audit --&gt; Lighthouse[Lighthouse CI]&#10;    Audit --&gt; BrowserExt[浏览器扩展]&#10;&#10;    JestAxe --&gt; Fast[快速反馈: PR 阶段]&#10;    CypressAxe --&gt; Integration[集成验证: 页面级]&#10;    Lighthouse --&gt; Score[评分趋势追踪]\">graph TD\n    Tests[无障碍自动化测试] --&gt; Unit[单元测试层]\n    Tests --&gt; E2E[E2E 测试层]\n    Tests --&gt; Audit[审计扫描层]\n\n    Unit --&gt; JestAxe[jest-axe / @axe-core/react]\n    E2E --&gt; CypressAxe[cypress-axe / playwright-axe]\n    Audit --&gt; Lighthouse[Lighthouse CI]\n    Audit --&gt; BrowserExt[浏览器扩展]\n\n    JestAxe --&gt; Fast[快速反馈: PR 阶段]\n    CypressAxe --&gt; Integration[集成验证: 页面级]\n    Lighthouse --&gt; Score[评分趋势追踪]</pre><h2 id=\"axe-core-核心规则引擎\">axe-core：核心规则引擎</h2><p>axe-core 是 Deque Systems 开源的无障碍测试引擎，对应超过 70 条 WCAG 规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>主页：<a href=\"https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core\">https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core</a></li>\n<li>规则文档：<a href=\"https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/\">https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"在浏览器中直接使用\">在浏览器中直接使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;script src=&quot;https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/axe-core/4.9.1/axe.min.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&lt;script&gt;&#10;  axe&#10;    .run(document, {&#10;      runOnly: [&#39;wcag2a&#39;, &#39;wcag2aa&#39;, &#39;wcag21aa&#39;, &#39;wcag22aa&#39;],&#10;    })&#10;    .then((results) =&gt; {&#10;      console.log(&#39;违规:&#39;, results.violations);&#10;      console.log(&#39;通过:&#39;, results.passes);&#10;      console.log(&#39;不完整（需人工确认）:&#39;, results.incomplete);&#10;    });&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/axe-core/4.9.1/axe.min.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  axe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(document, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      runOnly: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag21aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag22aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">results</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'违规:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, results.violations);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'通过:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, results.passes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不完整（需人工确认）:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, results.incomplete);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"结果结构解读\">结果结构解读</h3><p>axe.run 返回的结果分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>violations</code></td>\n<td>确定的违规（需修复）</td>\n<td>列入 CI 失败条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>incomplete</code></td>\n<td>无法确定需人工确认</td>\n<td>人工复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>passes</code></td>\n<td>通过的规则</td>\n<td>记录但不需处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inapplicable</code></td>\n<td>规则不适用于当前页面</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每个 violation 包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"{&#10;  id: &#39;color-contrast&#39;,         // 规则 ID&#10;  impact: &#39;serious&#39;,            // critical / serious / moderate / minor&#10;  description: &#39;颜色对比度...&#39;,&#10;  nodes: [{                     // 受影响的 DOM 节点&#10;    html: &#39;&lt;button ...&gt;&#39;,&#10;    target: [&#39;#submit-btn&#39;],&#10;    failureSummary: &#39;...&#39;&#10;  }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'color-contrast'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 规则 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  impact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'serious'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// critical / serious / moderate / minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'颜色对比度...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  nodes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{                     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 受影响的 DOM 节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    html: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;button ...>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#submit-btn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    failureSummary: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'...'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"jest-axe-单元测试集成\">jest-axe：单元测试集成</h2><p>jest-axe 将 axe-core 集成到 Jest/Vitest 测试套件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install --save-dev jest-axe @testing-library/react\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --save-dev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jest-axe</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @testing-library/react</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { render } from &#39;@testing-library/react&#39;;&#10;import { axe, toHaveNoViolations } from &#39;jest-axe&#39;;&#10;&#10;expect.extend(toHaveNoViolations);&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;Button 组件无障碍测试&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  test(&#39;默认状态无违规&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const { container } = render(&lt;Button&gt;提交&lt;/Button&gt;);&#10;    const results = await axe(container, {&#10;      rules: {&#10;        // 仅检测 AA 级别违规&#10;        &#39;color-contrast&#39;: { enabled: true },&#10;      },&#10;    });&#10;    expect(results).toHaveNoViolations();&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  test(&#39;禁用状态无违规&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const { container } = render(&lt;Button disabled&gt;提交&lt;/Button&gt;);&#10;    const results = await axe(container);&#10;    expect(results).toHaveNoViolations();&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  test(&#39;加载状态无违规&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const { container } = render(&lt;Button loading&gt;提交&lt;/Button&gt;);&#10;    const results = await axe(container);&#10;    expect(results).toHaveNoViolations();&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { render } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@testing-library/react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { axe, toHaveNoViolations } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'jest-axe'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">expect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">extend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(toHaveNoViolations);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Button 组件无障碍测试'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'默认状态无违规'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"col