ki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lighthouse-综合质量评估\">Lighthouse：综合质量评估</h2><p>Google Lighthouse 提供无障碍评分（0-100）和具体违规说明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 命令行使用&#10;npx lighthouse https://example.com --output json --output html \\&#10;  --only-categories=accessibility&#10;&#10;# 提取无障碍分数&#10;npx lighthouse https://example.com --output json | \\&#10;  node -e &quot;const d=require(&#39;/dev/stdin&#39;);console.log(d.categories.accessibility.score*100)&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 命令行使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lighthouse</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://example.com</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --output</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --output</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> html</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --only-categories=accessibility</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 提取无障碍分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lighthouse</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://example.com</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --output</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  node</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"const d=require('/dev/stdin');console.log(d.categories.accessibility.score*100)\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lighthouse 无障碍评分的局限性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>评分基于自动化检测（axe + Google 自研规则）</li>\n<li>分数 100 不等于 WCAG AA 合规</li>\n<li>评分受测试时 DOM 状态影响（动态内容可能未被检测）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Lighthouse CI（LHCI）可将 Lighthouse 结果集成到 CI 流水线，设置评分阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# lighthouserc.yml&#10;ci:&#10;  collect:&#10;    url:&#10;      - http://localhost:3000&#10;      - http://localhost:3000/about&#10;  assert:&#10;    assertions:&#10;      categories:accessibility:&#10;        - error&#10;        - minScore: 0.9\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># lighthouserc.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  collect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://localhost:3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://localhost:3000/about</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    assertions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      categories:accessibility</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">minScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"浏览器扩展工具\">浏览器扩展工具</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>axe DevTools</td>\n<td>Chrome/Firefox</td>\n<td>最全面，支持 WCAG 逐条过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAVE</td>\n<td>Chrome/Firefox</td>\n<td>可视化标注，适合向设计师展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accessibility Insights</td>\n<td>Chrome</td>\n<td>Microsoft 出品，支持引导式测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Color Contrast Analyzer</td>\n<td>独立应用</td>\n<td>精确的颜色对比度测量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>WAVE 的特色</strong>：在页面上直接用图标标注无障碍问题（错误用红色，警告用黄色，结构标注用蓝色），直观地展示语义结构，适合作为设计评审工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化工具的规则优先级\">自动化工具的规则优先级</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>影响级别</th>\n<th>处理优先级</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>critical</td>\n<td>立即修复，阻断发布</td>\n<td>元素 ID 重复、按钮无名称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>serious</td>\n<td>纳入当前迭代修复</td>\n<td>颜色对比度不足、aria 使用错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>moderate</td>\n<td>计划修复</td>\n<td>标签顺序问题、缺少地标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>minor</td>\n<td>持续改进</td>\n<td>过长 alt 文本、缺少跳过链接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>建议在 CI 中将 <code>critical</code> 和 <code>serious</code> 设为阻断发布条件，<code>moderate</code> 和 <code>minor</code> 报告但不阻断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相关章节的关系\">与相关章节的关系</h2><p><a href=\"manual-testing-screen-readers\">手动测试与屏幕阅读器</a>覆盖了自动化工具无法检测的交互问题；<a href=\"ci-accessibility-gates\">CI 无障碍门禁</a>介绍如何将这些工具集成到持续交付流程中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>axe-core 是无障碍自动化测试的核心引擎，通过 jest-axe（单元测试）和 cypress-axe（E2E 测试）两个层次覆盖不同测试场景。Lighthouse 提供总体评分，浏览器扩展工具用于开发期间的快速检测。自动化测试的覆盖率约 30-40%，必须配合手动测试才能全面保障质量。在 CI 中将 critical 和 serious 级别的违规设为阻断条件，是将无障碍纳入工程质量门禁的关键一步。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动化无障碍测试工具：axe-core、Lighthouse 与浏览器扩展","id":"自动化无障碍测试工具-axe-core-lighthouse-与浏览器扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化测试工具的分层架构","id":"自动化测试工具的分层架构"},{"level":2,"text":"axe-core：核心规则引擎","id":"axe-core-核心规则引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"在浏览器中直接使用","id":"在浏览器中直接使用"},{"level":3,"text":"结果结构解读","id":"结果结构解读"},{"level":2,"text":"jest-axe：单元测试集成","id":"jest-axe-单元测试集成"},{"level":2,"text":"cypress-axe：端到端测试集成","id":"cypress-axe-端到端测试集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Lighthouse：综合质量评估","id":"lighthouse-综合质量评估"},{"level":2,"text":"浏览器扩展工具","id":"浏览器扩展工具"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化工具的规则优先级","id":"自动化工具的规则优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"与相关章节的关系","id":"与相关章节的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动态内容与 Live Regions：实时变化的无障碍通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/implementation/dynamic-content-live-regions"},"next":{"title":"手动测试与屏幕阅读器：发现自动化工具的盲区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/testing/manual-testing-screen-readers"}}